        "title": "Kation va anionni farqlang",
        "body": "Musbat zaryadli ion kation, manfiy zaryadli ion anion deyiladi. Na+ — kation, Cl− — anion. Musbat va manfiy zaryad atamalarini neytral atomning proton yoki elektron soni bilan almashtirmang.",
